	(generator_version "9.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Male 2x20 2.54mm header for the Waveshare ESP32-P4-WIFI6-Touch-LCD-3.4C (female J8 socket on its back). Pin numbering corrected 2026-11-21 after a continuity test on the real module: pin 1 (GND, square pad) at the end away from pins 39/40 (3V3/5V); D-/D+ = pins 13/14. Board outline, 115mm display, holes and connectors from the DXF.")
